@host=http://127.0.0.1:18881

### query token auth
GET {{host}}/token_auth/query?token=abc HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### param token auth
GET {{host}}/token_auth/param/abc HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

### form token auth
POST {{host}}/token_auth/form HTTP/1.1
content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded; charset=UTF-8

action=user_login&token=abc

### header token auth
GET {{host}}/token_auth/header HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer abc

### cookie token auth
GET {{host}}/token_auth/cookie HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
cookie: token=abc